# Census: unit creation, lifecycle and modes (sim/units.md §1-§6) in the empty
# Blood Moor: a monster, a super unique, an object, a ground item and a
# missile are created by pokes, each class of unit type 0-5 once. State and
# rng channels.
name sys-units-census
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 140
seconds 360
channels state rng
variant blood-moor-empty
at 4 poke warp 2
at 30 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 30 poke seed-unit @player 0x00000055 666
at 30 poke spawn 19 @x+4 @y+4 normal
at 34 poke object 119 @x-4 @y+4
at 38 poke item hp1 @x+2 @y+2
at 42 poke missile 12 @x @y @x+5 @y+5 skill 7 5
at 46 poke spawn 19 @x+5 @y-5 unique umod 3
at 60 poke spawn 19 @x-5 @y-5 champion umod 16
